{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，新吾。你对爱理她们说了什么？”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4414", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说了什么？”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为她们每个人都笑得让人不舒服，还说我们圣诞节可以放假。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4415", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我就在想是不是新吾背地里安排了什么让我们能放假。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4416", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我什么都没做，不过的确不太自然。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以相对的，今天是由我跟纱凪两人负责照顾动物。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“算了也好啦。反正２４日下午能放假了。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4417", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，你还记得约定吗？”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4418", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我要当圣诞老人送礼物给理央君对吧？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，所以，锵锵！穿平常的衣服就没有气氛了，所以我准备了圣诞老人的衣服和麋鹿的布偶装。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4419", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“穿上这个，在半夜从窗户爬进理央的房间。当天就用这个作战，麻烦你啦！”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4420", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“相当正统呢。是说，这些服装从谁那里拿到的？”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我看到万智老师在校舍后面的焚烧炉正要处理掉衣服，所以我就要来了。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4421", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“听她说她每年都会穿着这个一个人庆祝。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4422", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一、一个人？”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。她还说不建议一个人打扮成麋鹿。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4423", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一瞬间，我想像了万智老师一个人在家里打扮成麋鹿的样子。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有点看不下去。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是开玩笑也笑不出来。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～干脆我们试穿一下？我也有点在意尺寸合不合……”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4424", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，那我……”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来，麋鹿。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4425", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“圣诞老人由我来当，拉雪橇的麋鹿就麻烦新吾你了♪”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4426", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，等一下。说到圣诞老人就是留着白胡须的老人吧？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4427", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那身为男人的我应该比较适合……”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这也没办法啊，圣诞老人的衣服是女孩子的尺寸，麋鹿的布偶装是均码的。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4428", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，这是女孩子穿的圣诞老人装喔。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4429", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么嘛，那个怀疑的眼神。总之我穿穿看吧，新吾出去外面。”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4430", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，这个是麋鹿的布偶装。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4431", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她递给我一个白色纸袋，把我赶出社团教室。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……好冷。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也换上麋鹿装吧。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了当圣诞老人，我在浴室还偷偷练习过的说……", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说起来，女孩子穿的圣诞老人装是什么呢？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉像是表演用的，没什么说服力。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对方是理央君，要很讲究细节才行。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "等一下就严格一点判断吧。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我想着想着很快就换好了布偶装。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，可以进来了喔。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4432", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我听到社团教室里传来声音，于是我推开门进去。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“圣诞快乐～～♪”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4433", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿嘿，怎么样？会奇怪吗？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4434", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，怎么样怎么样？”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4435", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪提着裙摆，朝我翘起屁股。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“意外地很可爱呢。我要重新看待万智老师的品味了。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4436", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "服装很可爱没错，但更惊人的是纱凪本身的可爱。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女孩子扮成圣诞老人太合适了。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不需要什么男性圣诞老人了。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，新吾的装扮……噗颗颗！”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4437", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到她的笑声我回过神来。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很奇怪吗？”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会，太适合了吧！太可爱了我好心动……噗！”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4438", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪现在说的话我无法相信。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿～连项圈和铃铛都有呢。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4439", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“项圈有点紧。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，万智老师有提到这个。项圈是她自己用的，所以调比较紧要注意。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4440", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……自己用的？这个项圈？”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大概是很讲究细节吧？她说项圈要紧一点比较好。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4441", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越来越不懂万智老师了。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过打扮成这样一下子就兴奋起来了呢。啊～好想快点到圣诞节～”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4442", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要那样蹦蹦跳跳的比较好。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4443", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为裙子很短。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯，裙子？”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4444", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪提起裙摆，看向自己的双腿。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后跳了两下，再次朝我翘起屁股。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看啊看啊，是赤裸的双腿喔～♪”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4445", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要恶作剧，还有不要翘起屁股。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔，男人真难搞。我已经很努力装可爱了，居然不对我这样的表现心动。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4446", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“心动了喔，非常心动。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“麋鹿真拼命呢。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4447", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这女孩真的没有自觉。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自己在一般人眼中到底有多可爱……", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～果然不穿内裤下半身凉凉的不太自在。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4448", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不能不穿内裤吧！”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噗，我开玩笑的啦！不用那么认真嘛。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4449", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、咕……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀小麋鹿真的好可爱喔♪好乖好乖，摸摸你的头喔～”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4450", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "完全被当成玩具了。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我并不讨厌。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噗噗，一想起来就想笑。新吾也有那么拼命的时候啊。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4451", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐呐，你想要什么礼物？瞄一下瞄一下♪”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4452", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不需要礼物啦。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸，生气了？”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4453", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是。”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要纱凪在就好了。”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4454", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不是纱凪而是圣诞老人啦……是说，麋鹿不准勾引圣诞老人！”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4455", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，麋鹿的叫声是什么呢？”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘻～嘻～吧？”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4456", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎么可能那样叫。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，快点嘻～嘻～叫看看嘛。我想看新吾嘻～嘻～地叫♪”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4457", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，叫嘛。嘻～嘻～叫看看？不行？叫不出来？”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4458", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要你叫，我就再跳一下然后翘屁股给你看喔♪”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_sn4459", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘻～嘻～”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的心中似乎有什么重要的东西崩坏了。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
